!!re i/x1/x2:;                          [Process the selected creature ID range]
    !!if&x3=1;                          [run rebalanced stats active]
        !!EAi:B0/1/72/37/y10/y20/y21/y22/y23/y24/y25/y26/y27/y28/y29; [Health]
